  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek Dokuzlusu\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\nBir s\xFCre \xF6nce hayallerine ula\u015Fabilmek i\xE7in ya\u015Fam\u0131
    s\u0131ms\u0131k\u0131 tutmay\u0131, sarsmay\u0131 ve hedeflerine sald\u0131rmay\u0131
    b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n gibi, kendini d\xFC\u015Fmanlar\u0131na ve ba\u015F\u0131na
    gelebilecek k\xF6t\xFC olaylara kar\u015F\u0131 savunmay\u0131 da b\u0131rakm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n
    {{isim}}. O ya da bu sebeple s\xFCrekli efor sarf etmekten yorulmu\u015F, bir
    noktadan sonra olaylar\u0131 ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na b\u0131rakarak ruhunu r\xF6lantiye
    alm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Bu hal ve durum, kar\u015F\u0131na \xE7\u0131kan f\u0131rsatlar\u0131
    zaman zaman ka\xE7\u0131rmana neden oldu\u011Fu gibi, potansiyel tehlikelere
    kar\u015F\u0131 da seni a\xE7\u0131k hedef haline getirmi\u015F. \u0130\xE7inde
    bulundu\u011Fun harp devam etse, belki de galip sen olacakt\u0131n."
